{"uid":"skills/lazyown_daemon.py","name":"lazyown_daemon.py","qualname":"skills/lazyown_daemon.py","kind":"module","file":"skills/lazyown_daemon.py","line":1,"end_line":545,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"LazyOwn Unified Daemon ====================== Replaces three separate background processes with a single asyncio daemon:","description":"Role 1 — File Watcher     (was: sessions_watcher.py)\n    Watches sessions/ for new/modified files:\n    - scan_*.nmap     → generate plan.txt via Ollama, inject PLAN_READY objective\n    - scan_*.nmap.xml → ingest into FactStore, update soul.md OS hint\n    - sessions/<ip>/<port>/<tool>/*.txt → ingest into FactStore, update soul.md creds\n    - sessions/plan.txt → emit PLAN_UPDATED event\n\n  Role 2 — Event Engine Poll (was: heartbeat.py + event_engine CSV tail)\n    Every N seconds: tail LazyOwn_session_report.csv for new rows →\n    run rule matching → emit matched events to events.jsonl\n\n  Role 3 — Heartbeat        (was: heartbeat.py)\n    Every 30 seconds: emit a HEARTBEAT event so the MCP can verify the daemon\n    is alive; update sessions/daemon_status.json with uptime and stats.\n\nCommunication:\n  All roles share a single asyncio.Queue for internal events.\n  External consumers (MCP) read sessions/events.jsonl as before — no interface change.\n\nManagement:\n  python3 skills/lazyown_daemon.py start    # fork and detach\n  python3 skills/lazyown_daemon.py stop     # kill via PID file\n  python3 skills/lazyown_daemon.py status   # print status from daemon_status.json\n  python3 skills/lazyown_daemon.py run      # run in foreground (for debugging)\n\nPID file: sessions/daemon.pid\nStatus file: sessions/daemon_status.json","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["skills/lazyown_daemon.py::BASE_DIR","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::SESSIONS_DIR","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::SKILLS_DIR","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::MODULES_DIR","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::PID_FILE","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::STATUS_FILE","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::ENGINE_INTERVAL_S","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::WATCHER_POLL_S","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_S","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::STATE_EVERY_N","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::NARRATE_EVERY_N","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::file_watcher_loop","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::file_event_consumer","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::event_engine_loop","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::heartbeat_loop","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::toposwarm_keepalive_loop","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::cmd_run","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::cmd_start","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::cmd_stop","skills/lazyown_daemon.py::cmd_status"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
